      "side": 1,
      "message": "`_rts5817_flash_bin` adds `--libs libusb-1.0` to `HOST_LDFLAGS` without adding `--cflags libusb-1.0` to `HOST_CXXFLAGS`:\n```makefile\n$(_rts5817_flash_bin): HOST_CXXFLAGS+\u003d$(shell $(HOST_PKG_CONFIG) \\\n\t--cflags libusb-1.0)\n```\nWhen building `ec-utils` / `ec-devutils` in Portage against a target board sysroot (`HOST_PKG_CONFIG`), omitting `--cflags libusb-1.0` breaks header resolution when `libusb-1.0` is not installed in the default host include path (compare `util/elan/build.mk`, `util/egis/build.mk`, and `util/focaltech/build.mk`).\n\nAlso consider adding `-fvisibility\u003dhidden` to `HOST_CXXFLAGS` on both `_rts5817_flash_bin` and `_rts5817_test_bin` (matching `util/egis/build.mk` and `util/focaltech/build.mk`).",
