      "writtenOn": "2026-10-30T19:07:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The commit message notes *\"DFU download completes and the device boots the new image\"*, but without a post-manifest `DFU_DETACH` (see comment on `rts5817_usb_device.cc:449-452` in CL 8629987), the RTS5817 stays enumerated in DFU mode (`0BDA:5800`) after `dfu_download()` returns.\n\nPlease ensure post-manifest `DFU_DETACH` is sent (either inside `dfu_download()` or right after it here), and consider polling `wait_for_device(vid, kRts5817Pid, ...)` afterward to confirm the device re-enumerated into runtime mode (`0BDA:5817`).",
      "range": {
